___1RM50" aria-disabled="false" aria-controls="_R_26b55_" aria-expanded="false">Maintain flexibility and seamless management of your codebase<span aria-hidden="true" class="Primer_Brand__RiverAccordion-module__RiverAccordion__icon___FMAZH"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="octicon octicon-triangle-down" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="currentColor" display="inline-block" overflow="visible" style="vertical-align:text-bottom"><path d="M11.646 15.146 5.854 9.354a.5.5 0 0 1 .353-.854h11.586a.5.5 0 0 1 .353.854l-5.793 5.792a.5.5 0 0 1-.707 0Z"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div class="Primer_Brand__RiverAccordion-module__RiverAccordion__panel___Y4GUN" id="_R_26b55_" aria-hidden="true"><div class="Primer_Brand__RiverAccordion-module__RiverAccordion__content___87sh8"><p class="Primer_Brand__Text-module__Text___XeGJJ Primer_Brand__Text-module__Text-font--mona-sans___a8XJD Primer_Brand__Text-module__Text--muted___rE6mh Primer_Brand__Text-module__Text--300___6_Yx4 Primer_Brand__Text-module__Text--antialiased___TYoXS">Make adjustments to update messages, incorporate new changes, or revert to earlier states when needed. Easily make changes to your project’s history with simple adjustments and reversals. </p></div><div class="Primer_Brand__RiverAccordion-module__RiverAccordion__visual___aIsob Primer_Brand__RiverAccordion-module__RiverAccordion__visual--has-background___JQ9GB FlexSuiteRiverMedia-module__visual__pJTYv"><div class="FlexSuiteRiverMedia-module__mediaFrame__9Fb1Y"><picture class="Primer_Brand__Image-module__Image__container___CEHRD Primer_Brand__Image-module__Image--aspect-ratio-custom___38Uyb" style="--brand-image-aspectRatio:1296 / 1120"><source srcSet="//images.ctfassets.net/8aevphvgewt8/6OgWFI7cyPSJnEkhaXM8Vc/6aeb5556531af18ab23e2f2698ca92fb/image-3.webp?w=480&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=90 1x, //images.ctfassets.net/8aevphvgewt8/6OgWFI7cyPSJnEkhaXM8Vc/6aeb5556531af18ab23e2f2698ca92fb/image-3.webp?w=960&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=90 2x" media="(ma